#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:173
msgid "Official Modern Branch (Latest stable NVIDIA drivers)"
msgstr "Resmi Modern Dal (En son kararlı NVIDIA sürücüleri)"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:175
msgid "Legacy Compatibility Branch (Pascal, Maxwell, and MX series)"
msgstr "Eski Uyumluluk Dalı (Pascal, Maxwell ve MX serisi)"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:177
msgid "Legacy generation cards no longer officially supported"
msgstr "Resmi desteği sonlandırılmış eski nesil kartlar"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:224
#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:240
msgid "NVIDIA Driver Manager"
msgstr "NVIDIA Sürücü Yöneticisi"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:269
msgid "No NVIDIA GPU Found"
msgstr "NVIDIA Ekran Kartı Bulunamadı"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:271
msgid ""
"The system did not detect any NVIDIA graphics card connected to your device.\n"
"If your computer has hybrid graphics (Optimus), please ensure it is enabled in your BIOS/UEFI settings."
msgstr ""
"Sistem, cihazınıza bağlı herhangi bir NVIDIA ekran kartı algılamadı.\n"
"Bilgisayarınızda hibrit grafik (Optimus) varsa, lütfen BIOS/UEFI ayarlarından etkinleştirildiğinden emin olun."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:282
msgid "NVIDIA Driver is Installed and Active!"
msgstr "NVIDIA Sürücüsü Yüklü ve Etkin!"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:285
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The NVIDIA driver is already installed on your system for ({card_names}).\n"
"The system is configured and ready with full hardware acceleration and Wayland support."
msgstr ""
"({card_names}) için sisteminizde NVIDIA sürücüsü zaten yüklü.\n"
"Sistem tam donanım hızlandırma ve Wayland desteğiyle yapılandırılmış ve hazırdır."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:300
msgid "Detected Hardware Status"
msgstr "Algılanan Donanım Durumu"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:304
msgid "Detected GPU:"
msgstr "Algılanan GPU:"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:310
msgid "Software Support Status:"
msgstr "Yazılım Destek Durumu:"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:311
msgid ""
"NVIDIA has officially discontinued proprietary driver support for this "
"legacy series"
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA bu eski seri için tescilli sürücü desteğini resmi olarak sonlandırdı"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:316
msgid "System Explanation for Stability"
msgstr "Kararlılık İçin Sistem Açıklaması"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:323
msgid ""
"• This GPU belongs to a legacy generation (Kepler / Fermi series or earlier) which is no longer compatible with modern Linux kernels and Wayland.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>Saifdora Silverblue</b> automatically utilizes the built-in, stable open-source driver (<b>Nouveau / NVK</b>) to prevent display server crashes and ensure maximum stability.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>No action is required;</b> your system is ready and operating efficiently."
msgstr ""
"• Bu GPU, artık modern Linux çekirdekleri ve Wayland ile uyumlu olmayan eski bir nesle (Kepler / Fermi serisi veya öncesi) aittir.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>Saifdora Silverblue</b>, ekran sunucusu çökmelerini önlemek ve maksimum kararlılık sağlamak için otomatik olarak yerleşik ve kararlı açık kaynaklı sürücüyü (<b>Nouveau / NVK</b>) kullanır.\n"
"\n"
"• <b>Herhangi bir işlem yapmanız gerekmez;</b> sisteminiz hazır ve verimli çalışmaktadır."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:333
msgid "Detected Graphics Card Information"
msgstr "Algılanan Ekran Kartı Bilgileri"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:337
msgid "Card Name:"
msgstr "Kart Adı:"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:343
msgid "Recommended Driver Package:"
msgstr "Önerilen Sürücü Paketi:"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:352
msgid "Additional Package Options"
msgstr "Ek Paket Seçenekleri"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:356
msgid "Include Compute Acceleration & AI Libraries (CUDA)"
msgstr "Hesaplama Hızlandırma ve Yapay Zeka Kütüphanelerini (CUDA) Dahil Et"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:359
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {pkg} required for Blender, video editing, and deep learning "
"workflows"
msgstr ""
"Blender, video düzenleme ve derin öğrenme iş akışları için gerekli {pkg} "
"paketini kurun"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:367
msgid "Secure Boot Protection"
msgstr "Secure Boot Koruması"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:371
msgid "Secure Boot is enabled on your system"
msgstr "Sisteminizde Secure Boot etkin"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:372
msgid ""
"Linux requires signing the kernel module with a temporary MOK key to load "
"during boot."
msgstr ""
"Linux, önyükleme sırasında çekirdek modülünün yüklenebilmesi için geçici bir"
" MOK anahtarıyla imzalanmasını gerektirir."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:377
msgid "Temporary MOK password (save it to enter upon reboot):"
msgstr "Geçici MOK parolası (yeniden başlatmada girmek üzere kaydedin):"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:384
msgid "Start Installation"
msgstr "Kurulumu Başlat"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:387
msgid "Install Drivers Now"
msgstr "Sürücüleri Şimdi Kur"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:404
msgid "Preparing installation environment..."
msgstr "Kurulum ortamı hazırlanıyor..."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:428
msgid "Restart Now to Apply Drivers"
msgstr "Sürücüleri Uygulamak İçin Şimdi Yeniden Başlat"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:447
msgid "Please enter a temporary MOK password before proceeding."
msgstr "Lütfen devam etmeden önce geçici bir MOK parolası girin."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:521
msgid "Requesting administrator privileges and connecting to repositories..."
msgstr "Yönetici ayrıcalıkları isteniyor ve depolara bağlanılıyor..."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:547
msgid "Installation completed successfully!"
msgstr "Kurulum başarıyla tamamlandı!"

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:548
msgid ""
"NVIDIA driver installation completed successfully! Please restart your "
"computer to activate."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA sürücü kurulumu başarıyla tamamlandı! Etkinleştirmek için lütfen "
"bilgisayarınızı yeniden başlatın."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:554
msgid "An error occurred or the installation was cancelled."
msgstr "Bir hata oluştu veya kurulum iptal edildi."

#: /home/saifeldin/Projects/saifdora-Silverblue-45/files/system/usr/bin/saifdora-nvidia-manager:555
msgid "Installation failed or authorization was cancelled by the user."
msgstr ""
"Kurulum başarısız oldu veya yetkilendirme kullanıcı tarafından iptal edildi."
